          "Seaside-village and ama analogs: Seongsan Ilchulbong (KRW 5,000, opens before the ~06:50 sunrise), Udo ferry (KRW 11,000), free haenyeo dive show, Olle 7 coastal walk, Seogwipo Maeil Olle Market. A Fri/Sat Saeyeon Bridge night show runs Oct 23-24.",
