    "critique": {
      "gaps": [
        {
          "key": "gyeongju_ragung_status_and_alternatives",
          "question": "Is Ragung Hotel (Gyeongju Bomun, 라궁) still operating and bookable for 3 adults on a weekday night of Oct 20-23, 2026, and at what real price? Give live prices for the same dates for the fallback stays too. Steps: (1) Search Naver Map / Kakao Map place pages for '경주 라궁' and check for a 'closed' (폐업) flag, recent reviews from Sep-Oct 2026 and the phone number +82-54-778-2100. Try map.naver.com, place.map.kakao.com, yanolja.com, goodchoice (yeogi.com), agoda.com, trip.com and booking.com for 'Ragung' or 'Lagung'. ragung.co.kr does not resolve. (2) For each property, get the total for 3 adults (incl. extra-adult fee) on Tue Oct 20, Wed Oct 21 or Thu Oct 22: Ragung; Hwangnamguan Hanok Village (downtown, walkable to the Daereungwon-Wolji night loop); Hilton Gyeongju; Lahan Select Gyeongju; Sono Calm Gyeongju; and a Bomun property with its own hot-spring bath, if one exists. Also confirm Commodore and Kolon Gyeongju are open. Say whether breakfast is included and whether the 3rd person needs an extra bed.",
          "why_it_matters": "Ragung is the planned Izu-ryokan analog and anchors shapes (a) and (c). heritage.json gives it medium confidence at 280-450k for 3, anchored on an April 2025 source, while vibe.json says its official domain no longer resolves. Every Gyeongju alternative price is low confidence (Wikivoyage or pre-2026 data). If Ragung is closed, the onsen-ryokan element must move to Busan (Paradise/Cimer, Ananti) or Gangwon, which changes the itinerary shape and the budget."
        },
        {
          "key": "seoul_busan_live_lodging_for_3",
          "question": "Get live total prices for 3 adults in ONE booking (one 2-bedroom or family/triple room, or state that 2 rooms are needed) for these likely bases and dates. Seoul (Jongno/Myeongdong), Sat Oct 17 to about Tue Oct 20 or Wed Oct 21, plus the optional Fri Oct 16 night for dawn check-in: Fraser Place Central Seoul 2BR, Somerset Palace Seoul 2BR, Nine Tree by Parnas Myeongdong 2 family room, and Rakkojae Seoul (3-person ondol). Busan, Thu Oct 22 or Fri Oct 23 to Sun Oct 25 (Saturday is drone-show night): Paradise Hotel Busan (ocean-view deluxe + extra bed; ask whether the Cimer spa is included), Ananti at Busan Cove (Cabin S + 50,000 extra bed), Hotel Nongshim triple ondol, Shilla Stay Haeundae family twin, and Hotel Aqua Palace Gwangalli bridge-view family room. Use agoda.com, booking.com, trip.com and hotelscombined.com with the adults=3 parameter, and the official pages (frasershospitality.com, ananti.kr/en/busan, hotelnongshim.com, busanparadisehotel.co.kr). Report per-night and total KRW with taxes, and the cancellation policy.",
          "why_it_matters": "Lodging is the largest line in the US$3,000 budget. Seoul prices (330-620k for a 2BR) and Busan prices (Paradise 350-650k, Ananti 350-700k, Nongshim 180-300k) are estimates from 2-guest snapshots. The Saturday Oct 17 and Saturday Oct 24 nights are peak. Without real numbers for 3, no option can be shown to fit under budget."
        },
        {
          "key": "gangwon_lodging_and_hotspring_status",
          "question": "Get live late-October 2026 prices for 3 adults at the likely Sokcho, Seorak and Gangneung bases, and confirm the hot-spring options. (1) Find weekday (Mon Oct 19-Thu Oct 22) and Friday Oct 23 prices for 3 adults at Hanwha Resort Seorak Sorano (condo family), Kensington Hotel Seorak, Lotte Resort Sokcho, Sono/Sol Beach Yangyang, Skybay Gyeongpo, St. John's Gangneung, and Seongyojang Hanok Stay (Gangneung). Use yanolja.com, yeogi.com, agoda.com, trip.com, hanwharesort.co.kr and the knsj.co.kr/seongyojang site. (2) Confirm that Osaek Greenyard Hotel's hot-spring baths are operating in Oct 2026, with price and room rates; try Naver place pages and greenyard.co.kr. (3) Confirm Cheoksan Hot Spring (척산온천휴양촌) 2026 hours and price. (4) Check whether Seorak Waterpia's day pass is included or discounted for Sorano guests.",
          "why_it_matters": "Shapes (b) and (c) depend on Gangwon lodging, and every Gangwon lodging entry is low confidence (130-800k range). The file also warns that Saturday foliage-season rates run 1.5-2x weekday rates. The onsen substitute in Gangwon (Osaek Greenyard or Cheoksan) is unverified for 2026, and Seongyojang's role as the ryokan stand-in has no confirmed price or 3-person room."
        },
        {
          "key": "gyeongbokgung_starlight_foreigner_booking",
          "question": "Can 3 foreigners still get Gyeongbokgung Starlight Night Walk (경복궁 별빛야행) foreigner-session tickets for Wed Oct 21 to Sat Oct 24, 2026? Steps: (1) Check creatrip.com/en/spot/13949 for remaining or released seats; seoul.json says it was sold out Oct 6, with free cancellation up to 3 days before. (2) Check NOL World (world.nol.com, formerly Interpark Global), Ticketlink (ticketlink.co.kr) for general sessions and whether foreigners can buy them, and kh.or.kr / royal.khs.go.kr notices. (3) Settle the session times (events.json says 18:30/19:40; seoul.json says 18:20/19:30) and the 2026 price (60,000 KRW pp assumed). (4) If there is no realistic path, confirm a fallback evening: Deoksugung or Changgyeonggung night opening hours that week (and the Changgyeonggung 'Mulbit Yeonhwa' program, with foreigner booking), and whether Wednesday 'Culture Day' free entry applies.",
          "why_it_matters": "It is the single best special event in the window and is only available Oct 21-24, so it would pin the Seoul nights to the back half of the trip. That conflicts with putting Busan on Sat Oct 24 for the drone show and with Gangwon weekdays. The two files disagree on availability and session times."
        },
        {
          "key": "seorak_cablecar_heullimgol_bus_2026",
          "question": "Confirm the Seoraksan rules for Oct 19-23, 2026. (1) Seorak cable car (sorakcablecar.co.kr): October 2026 first and last departure, the 16,000 KRW adult round-trip fare, the same-day on-site-only sale, any cap on tickets per person, and the time weekday tickets typically sell out. (2) Heullimgol (흘림골) on the KNPS reservation site (reservation.knps.or.kr, english.knps.or.kr, knps.or.kr notices): whether it is open in autumn 2026; whether a reservation is required, with the daily cap (gangwon says 5,000/day, which looks high), time slots, booking window and whether foreigners can book with a foreign phone or email; any 2026 rockfall closure; and the true reopening date (foliage says 2024, gangwon says Sep 6, 2022). Also confirm that the Juongol/Osaek out-and-back needs no booking. (3) Get the post-Oct-1, 2026 (+9% fare cap) Seoul-Sokcho express bus fare and Gangneung-Sokcho intercity fare on kobus.co.kr and bustago.or.kr or txbus.t-money.co.kr, and whether foreign cards work there.",
          "why_it_matters": "The Seorak day is the core of shapes (b) and (c) and must fall on a weekday at peak (KFS peak Oct 20; Weather i peak Oct 25). If Heullimgol needs a reservation that is full or closed, the plan becomes cable car + Biseondae only. Two files contradict each other on Heullimgol's status, and both its reservation rules and the cable car hours are unverified."
        },
        {
          "key": "donghae_line_and_canonical_rail_fares",
          "question": "Verify Donghae-line and Korail details for the actual travel dates, and settle the rail fare conflicts. (1) On letskorail.com, korail.com or Korail Talk, or the train.asamaru.net timetables for 강릉→신경주(경주) and 강릉→부전 on the specific dates Wed Oct 21-Fri Oct 23, 2026, confirm the KTX-Eum departures (09:36 / 14:56 / 18:35), the exact Gyeongju arrival times (currently estimated at about 12:20), the fares (34,300 and 46,800) and whether seats are still available. Also confirm that the line starts at Gangneung rather than Jeongdongjin or Donghae. (2) Settle when the Donghae-line KTX-Eum started (logistics says Dec 30, 2024; gangwon says Dec 30, 2025). (3) Settle the booking window (logistics says 2 months ahead from Oct 1, 2026; gangwon and heritage say about 1 month). (4) Confirm the canonical post-merger fares: Seoul-Gyeongju KTX (logistics 44,500 vs heritage 49,300), Gyeongju-Busan Station (10,100 vs about 11,000), Seoul-Busan 54,400, Seoul-Gangneung 27,600, and AREX express (11,000 vs 13,000). (5) Check whether the Gangneung-Samcheok Sea Train still runs in Oct 2026.",
          "why_it_matters": "Shape (c) depends on a train that runs only 3 times a day in each direction, and its Gyeongju arrival time has never been read from a timetable. Fare disagreements of about 5,000 KRW pp per leg change every costed option. The booking-window conflict decides whether the planner must tell the group to book now."
        }
