        "Seoul-Gyeongju KTX fare: logistics.json gives 44,500 (after the Sep 2026 SRT merger fare cut); heritage.json gives about 49,300. Gyeongju-Busan: logistics gives 10,100; heritage gives about 11,000.",
        "Exchange rate: logistics.json uses 1,340 KRW per US$ (so US$1,000 is about 1,340,000 KRW); heritage.json and jeju.json use about 1,400. That is about a 4% difference in the budget ceiling.",
        "Korail booking window: logistics.json says tickets open 2 months ahead at 07:00 (from Oct 1, 2026); gangwon.json and heritage.json say about 1 month ahead.",
