          "Seoul: Somerset Palace is sold out for Oct 16-21 on Booking and Agoda, every unit type. Nine Tree Myeongdong 2 has no room for 3 and is sold out for Oct 17-21. Rakkojae Seoul shows 'no availability' on Trip.com, is not listed on Booking or Agoda, and its sister Bukchon Binkwan is full; rkj.co.kr did not load.",
          "Fraser Place Central is the only shortlisted Seoul property with space. Its Deluxe 2BR for 3 costs KRW 3,678,400 including VAT for Oct 16-21 (5 nights), 2,891,900 for Oct 17-21, or about 723-786k per night. That is roughly 90% of the whole US$3,000 budget, so it does not fit.",
