          "Hotel Nongshim's official site shows no rooms on any night from Oct 21 to 24. Shilla Stay Haeundae has only Sat Oct 24 open (family twin for 3 at about 417k with tax). Aqua Palace has only Thu Oct 22 open (family ondol or twin for 3 at about 207k with tax) and offered no bridge-view family room.",
          "Ananti Cove is the only shortlisted Busan hotel open on both Fri and Sat. On the official site, Cabin S Forest View costs 551k per night averaged over Fri-Sat (about 441k Fri, 661k Sat). A 3rd adult adds 50,000 for the extra guest plus 44,000 for the extra bed per night, for about 1.29M total for Fri-Sat for 3. Whether VAT is included in the room rate is not confirmed.",
          "Live options that fit the budget: Nine Tree by Parnas Dongdaemun Family Room for 3, Oct 16-21, KRW 1,736,141 with tax, free cancellation until Oct 13. 4rest Stay Jongno suite with breakfast, 1,475,638 non-refundable or 1,872,701 refundable until Oct 9. Gwangalli-Planet16 sea-view triple, Fri-Sat Oct 23-25, 403,434 with tax, free cancellation until Oct 20, walkable to the drone show, 2-night minimum."
